WEBVTT

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.510
Jewlie... the goddess appears!

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:14.280
The closet's doors open for you...

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.660
Within is a coord fit for a Divine Idol!

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.140
Lala, what happened just now-pri?

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.520
I... Where did you two go just now?

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:46.270
We were in the stands at a stage we'd never seen, and watched you perform.

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:49.360
What's this?

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:52.860
Everybody!

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:57.970
What Lala holds right now is a Super Cyalume Coord!

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.440
Super Cyalume?

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.420
What is that?

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.790
It sounds amazing!

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:08.310
Which is to say... the long-awaited
Divine Idol Grand Prix has now begun!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.660
What just happened?

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:11.510
Who was that goddess-looking person?

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:12.890
It was amazing...

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:16.910
The goddess Jewlie has made her appearance at last

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.780
in the Divine Idol Challenge concert Lala just performed!

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:22.590
A Divine Idol Challenge concert...

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:24.370
<i>The goddess Jewlie?</i>

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:27.260
She holds the key to becoming a Divine Idol?

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:29.170
<i>So that was...</i>

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.700
Mama!

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:36.190
Capisce!

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:38.390
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.940
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:43.190
Collect Divine Coords and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:46.720
One day, I discovered a mysterious baby in PriPara!

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:49.200
She started calling me "Mama"...

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.700
I can't believe this!

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.540
Has the caldron of Hell been opened?

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.670
I have no idea what just happened-kuma.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.350
Oh, hey, that's right-kuma...

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:37.450
Thanks a bunch, Kuma-san.

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.320
What's this thing, anyway-kuma?

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.760
So what was the thing you gave me-kuma?

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.950
It kind of looks like a compact mirror.

00:03:48.670 --> 00:03:50.900
But Lala, you were pri-amazing!

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:54.330
So <i>that's</i> how you get your hands on a Super Cyalume Coord...

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:57.560
The goddess Jewlie... she was beautiful...

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.030
Miss Lala!

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:00.670
Hold on a moment.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.640
I have something to discuss with you.

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:05.890
Hm?

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:10.030
Jewlie's <i>inside</i> this compact?

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:13.010
N–No, this isn't...

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:14.040
What is that-pri?

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.580
Yeah, Lala, what is it?

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:17.960
Miss Lala, what you hold is...

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:22.050
something essential to the success of the Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.290
Okay, I understand.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:31.800
Jululu, it's time for your milk.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.240
Julu...

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:39.130
It's a little baby!

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.770
I did not foresee this!

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:41.750
Just what has...

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:45.060
<i>That's</i> why Lala keeps blathering about babies!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:47.670
Yep. Her's name's Jululu.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:50.100
...Pri?

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:52.550
This child is the goddess Jewlie.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.380
The goddess... we just saw?

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:57.970
Indeed.

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.810
In truth, she should have arrived in Parajuku...

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:02.710
along with the new mics and coords.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.430
I couldn't anticipate she would be in this form.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.070
I see.

00:05:12.430 --> 00:05:13.930
That's quite the tale.

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:14.960
Yeah.

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:19.070
I couldn't imagine Jululu would turn out to be a goddess.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:21.320
At your service, O Divine One.

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.480
May blessings be upon us-usa!

00:05:24.030 --> 00:05:27.350
But just why is she in a child's form?

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:29.320
Is it bad if she's a baby?

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:30.520
Most certainly.

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:32.290
Have you forgotten?

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:36.750
Jewlie holds the key to becoming a Divine Idol.

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:40.550
Hewwo there, Jululu-usa!

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:41.200
Outta the way!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:41.330
Usa!
Outta the way!

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:41.540
Usa!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:42.080
Kuma!

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.760
Leave the little darling to me!

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.860
Dorothy, you're being too rough with her!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:49.730
Surely this interdimensional traveller was called to this realm by my hand.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:51.540
Who said anything about another dimension-pri?

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.430
Garuru wants to look after it, too!

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:57.890
You can leave the care of young Jululu to yours truly.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:00.670
Stylish!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.020
Hot... guy!

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.660
Mama!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:09.700
Jululu!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.200
Mama!

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.290
Aw, Jululu...

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.890
A shocking result.

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.120
No woman has ever rejected me before.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:24.240
I think we should just let Lala take care of her-pri.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:26.110
Me too!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.240
Mirei... Sophie...

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:31.400
I suppose there's nothing else for it.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.480
Isn't that great, Jululu?

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:34.810
Mama!

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.610
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.640
This is a news bulletin.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:43.910
Surely many of our viewers are aware,

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:46.070
but at a recent live concert...

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:50.800
The goddess Jewlie, who leads the path towards Divine Idol, has made her appearance!

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:55.410
She holds the power to grant the Divine Idol Challenge...

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:59.990
and bestows a Super Cyalume Coord upon those whose splendid performances move her!

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:05.270
A Super Cyalume Coords confers the right to take part in the Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:08.370
All idols watching, please give it your utmost!

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.470
This has been a message from the system.

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:12.620
PriPara-dong-ding.

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.850
It sounds amazing!

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.060
Should we enter?

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:19.300
It sounds like a blast, but also kind of hard.

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:22.230
Yeah, but I really want to try wearing a Super Cyalume Coord.

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:23.760
Wanna go for it?

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:25.670
All right, let's shoot for Divine Idol!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:26.430
I'm gonna do it too!

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:27.190
Me too!

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.900
Hang on, though.

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:32.050
Did Jululu give the Coord to Lala 'cause she's attached to her?

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:33.620
Isn't that unfair?

00:07:34.590 --> 00:07:35.690
That's not quite true.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:38.940
Jewlie is an unbiased arbiter.

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:42.090
That matter aside, further investigation is required.

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:43.950
Miss Lala.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.220
Y–Yes?

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.290
We leave Jululu in your care for the present.

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.630
Of course, that's capisce!

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:54.940
You'll do just fine. If you're in a tight spot at all, I'll...

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:56.940
I'll help you out!
Leave it to me!

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.680
Hey, I love kids!

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:04.650
And if I take care of her, a Super Cyalume Coord might just come my way!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:08.680
Dorothy, you've got your outer and inner dialogue mixed up.

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:09.110
Crud.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:10.320
Here.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.890
This is the Rosette Pact.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:16.210
Consider it an upgrade to your compact.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:18.280
Rosette Pact?

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:20.620
Hey, the design's different!

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:24.920
By using this compact to communicate, you can observe Jululu.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.780
Miss Lala...

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:29.460
Ask Jululu to go inside the Rosette Pact.

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.100
Jululu, can you go inside?

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:34.380
She's in there!

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.300
You can take care of her more easily this way.

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:40.040
Jululu, can you come over here?

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.770
She's so cute!

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.480
How peculiar...

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.750
Jululu, wanna say hi to Dorothy?

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:58.570
I am the Eternal Matriarch – does thou comprehend?

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.330
Mikan's your mummy, too!

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.230
Mama!

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:06.400
Play with Garuru too-garu!

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:10.520
She's asleep...

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:13.660
Stop calling her this way and that; it's exhausting!

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.070
Lala will be in charge of her...

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:20.250
and we'll help out if she's having a pri hard time of it!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:22.160
I think that's the best way.

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:27.500
And once again, please keep the matter of Jululu amongst yourselves.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.150
Okay!

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.900
Garuru doesn't wanna.
Garuru wants to show her off!

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:34.740
If you do that, Unicorn will give you a horning.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.460
Garu...

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:40.440
Thanks a bunch, Meganii!

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:52.390
Good morning!

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:54.770
I have to apologise, Manaka-san.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:57.510
I didn't realise the troubles you were facing with Jululu.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.140
Head Disciplinarian...

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:02.610
Don't overdo it; if you're ever in a right spot...

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:04.600
just let us know so we can help.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:07.060
That's what we have the Rosette Pacts for.

00:10:07.060 --> 00:10:09.060
Thanks a lot!

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:10.260
Capisce!

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:15.330
Pushu...

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:18.490
A student shall maintain due effort in scholarly and childcare pursuits!

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.350
The school regulations have considerable foresight.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.510
Honestly!

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:28.940
Don't you think your fans would be ashamed that their idol scored <i>this</i> low?

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.560
Focus on your studies!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.250
Capisce...

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:36.720
While you do, we'll take good care of Jululu!

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:39.420
Dorothy, you can't be so rough with her!

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:42.320
What a lovely smell...

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.140
You're right; babies do indeed have a bittersweet scent.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:51.820
Look, Jululu, it's a jellyfish! Jelly, jelly, jelly...

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:58.650
You have to multiply that before you calculate the rest-pri.

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:01.830
Your first play is to reduce to a common denominator.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.960
I'm finished!

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:06.580
Mirei, Shion, thanks a lot!

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:08.860
Keep it up for next time-pri.

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:10.150
Got it.

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:14.430
The Ticket-Snapping Meet is beary soon, everyone!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:15.450
Okay!

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:16.360
Let's <i>go</i>.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:20.510
That's no fun, coming all the way to PriPara and having to study-ucha!

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.330
Who's that girl?

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.760
Hey, is she...

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.550
The last member of Triangle?

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:33.140
Pushu!

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:34.840
Unawareness is the enemy!

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:35.810
We've been caught off guard.

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:37.230
And what's <i>your</i> gimmick, then?

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.100
Oh, wow!

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:44.160
It's the real SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé!

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:45.310
Huh?!

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:49.640
I'm super amazed! You're all so super cute!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.770
I've super always been your fan!

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:53.770
Th–Thank you...

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:55.000
What's your name?

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.670
It's super nice to meet you!

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:57.320
Ucha!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.940
I'm Kanon, a member of Triangle.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.050
Kano-pero!

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:14.810
You're Triangle's last member-pri?

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:15.940
Sure am!

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:19.270
Wow! Kanon's lost for words!

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:21.400
I'm super never gonna wash this hand again!

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:23.450
You should definitely wash your hands.

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:24.320
And gargle, too.

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.620
Ebearyone, let's get going!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.080
Did you forget about the Ticket-Snapping Meet?

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:31.540
You're right! We've got to go!

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:36.580
So Kanon is the last member...

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:39.710
I expected her to be way more overbearing.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:41.630
But she's your average Dorothy fan.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.680
She's <i>our</i> fan, not yours!

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:45.670
Hey...

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:47.920
It looks like someone left their Closet Trunk.

00:12:47.920 --> 00:12:48.560
Cha?

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:52.060
Lala's left her Closet Trunk behind-ucha!

00:12:52.060 --> 00:12:53.020
Dorothy-sama!

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:53.970
Reona-chan!

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:58.890
Line up here for Dressing Pafé and SoLaMi SMILE's Ticket-Snapping Meet-usa!

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:00.210
Thanks so much!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.640
Thanks for cheering us on!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:02.780
Overwhelming gratitude!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.320
Say what?

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:06.830
You forgot your Closet Trunk-pri?

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:08.740
Lala-san!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.570
You left this behind and I super came to bring it to you!

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.750
Thanks so much, Kanon-chan!

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:20.900
What's that?

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.070
One of Lala's school tests!

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:24.090
Thirteen points?
One of Lala's school tests!

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:24.910
Thirteen points?

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:27.490
Don't look!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.750
No, wait up, you stupid test!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.230
Lala scored thirteen points!

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:40.230
That's even worse than me!

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:42.230
No way!

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:46.600
It's not what it looks like! There are exceptional circumstances, see...

00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.320
Don't look! Please, don't look!

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:49.990
Lala doesn't get scores like this all the time!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:53.140
You can't even imagine what it's like studying and taking care of a baby at the same...

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:54.680
Stop right there-pri!

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:57.430
You're all awful!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.850
Just because she scored thirteen points...

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:02.460
You shouldn't laugh at her like that!

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:07.050
Lala's a wonderful person, even if she did score thirteen points!

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:09.560
You're way too harsh on her!

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:12.890
She only got the low, low score of thirteen on a test, you know!

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:18.480
She didn't score thirteen for who she is on the inside!

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:22.640
Lala's not a thirteen-point person at all!

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:24.050
She's a little better than that!

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:29.730
Kanon-chan... please, please stop...

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:30.450
Eh?

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:32.250
Whoopsie!

00:14:32.250 --> 00:14:37.740
Kano-pero!

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:39.850
Hey, quit hogging the shot!

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:47.830
Your dreams aren't out of reach...

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:51.220
Anyone can make theirs come true...

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:54.060
PriPara Pri-paradise!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:58.420
You're projecting very nicely-nekon.

00:14:59.070 --> 00:14:59.520
Hm?

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:03.130
That was super lovely! I'm super amazed!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.230
Totally-ucha!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.080
Th–Thank you.

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:07.200
But, you know...

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:11.060
Kanon thinks it would sound super better like this.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:11.660
Ucha!

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:13.200
You're totally covering us up-pri!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:19.890
Make it! You're unbeatable once you get started!

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:25.600
Make up! Headed for a gloriously shining future!

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:25.850
Ucha!

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:31.550
Your dreams aren't out of reach...

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:34.960
Anyone can make theirs come true...

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:37.600
PriPara Pri-paradise!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:39.640
Amazing...

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:41.760
How was it?

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.580
It was superb-ucha! It brought me to tears-ucha!

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:45.860
Your singing was pri good.

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:49.400
But it didn't convey anything.

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:51.150
What does that mean?

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:54.780
There was no depth of feeling.

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:58.840
All one receives is a self-conscious expression of cuteness.

